      "y": 395,
      "width": 287.09999999999997,
      "height": 68.75,
      "text": "STORES (key -> value):\n- commitments[bytes32 commitment] -> uint ts\n- reservedNames[bytes32 labelhash] -> bool\n- tldNode / tldSuffix / minCharLength\n- NFT-gate config; priceOracle ref (+ freeze)",
